    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp112483048">fodhnachgain</headword>
      <description>what is responsible for something, i.e. “Chan eil fiosam dè a tha air fodhnachgain do’n duine bhochd sin.”</description>
    </item>
    <item>
