    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp117531296">spuachlach</headword>
      <description>applied to a young boy, e.g. “Bha e na spuachlach balaich.” Similar to ‘cnabach de bhalach’.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp117533096">gu dubhlanach</headword>
